+   *
+   * <pre>
+   * option java_class = "MyProto";
+   *
+   * message Foo {
+   *   extensions 1000 to max;
+   * }
+   *
+   * extend Foo {
+   *   optional int32 bar;
+   * }
+   * </pre>
+   *
+   * <p>Then you might write code like:
+   *
+   * <pre>
+   * MyProto.Foo foo = getFoo();
+   * int i = foo.getExtension(MyProto.bar);
+   * </pre>
